common routine Work4[T, A, B, C, D].construct(result: T, entry: Callable[(A, B, C, D), T], first: A,
    second: B, third: C, fourth: D) -> Me
    return Me(result: steal result, entry, first: steal first, second: steal second,
        third: steal third, fourth: steal fourth)

### Ends what the block still holds, the last field first: the result nobody retrieved, or the arguments of work
### that never ran. A hollow place (an argument the work's routine took, a result `retrieve` took out) is left alone.
routine @Work4[T, A, B, C, D].destruct() -> None
    if not is_hollow_value(me.fourth)
        drop me.fourth
