common routine VoidWork0.construct(entry: Callable[(), None]) -> Me
    return Me(entry)

### Makes a `VoidWork1` from its fields.
### :param entry: Its `entry`.
### :param first: Its `first`.
### :returns: The new value.
common routine VoidWork1[A].construct(entry: Callable[(A,), None], first: A) -> Me
    return Me(entry, first: steal first)

### Ends the arguments of work that never ran, the last first. A hollow place (an argument the work's routine took)
### is left alone.
routine @VoidWork1[A].destruct() -> None
